    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ventomori</strong> is a 3D asymmetric puzzle co-op that places you centre stage as intrepid astronauts on their way to Planet M-113, Xanahspati, hoping to unveil the secrets behind a mysterious distress call. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join forces to brave the unknown,</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to be the eyes from above on the space station as the Control player or conquer your fears as you plunge headfirst towards planet Xanahspati as the Scout. Work in tandem to solve puzzles, uncover secrets, and ensure each other\u2019s survival as you traverse. But be careful, silence here\u2026 is quite deadly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477530/extras/8b2278e17ec87aa7efa5d7f3614c22ff.poster.webp?t=1750782473\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477530/extras/8b2278e17ec87aa7efa5d7f3614c22ff.webp?t=1750782473\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477530/extras/35a646bc71ae33dbc23d954835efa387.poster.webp?t=1750782473\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477530/extras/35a646bc71ae33dbc23d954835efa387.webp?t=1750782473\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the past, reveal the future,</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Towering ruins of intrigue await in this narrative driven world. Take in the melancholic sights and deduce the history of the unseen Padullurians as you navigate around monoliths of ancient, alien technology and the planet\u2019s harsh, bone-rending winds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477530/extras/8c6577cef5100d6a5f7842a61f4a9ae4.poster.webp?t=1750782473\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477530/extras/8c6577cef5100d6a5f7842a61f4a9ae4.webp?t=1750782473\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If at first you don\u2019t succeed\u2026,</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try and try again to hone your experience with each attempt. With every pass, you gain the most valuable of resources. The digital bodies may fade, but the ever-present minds remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477530/extras/b4f0975e7971aaa4ab2f34353fb4fcfd.poster.webp?t=1750782473\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477530/extras/b4f0975e7971aaa4ab2f34353fb4fcfd.webp?t=1750782473\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ventomori</strong> is a 3D asymmetric puzzle co-op that places you centre stage as intrepid astronauts on their way to Planet M-113, Xanahspati, hoping to unveil the secrets behind a mysterious distress call. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join forces to brave the unknown,</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to be the eyes from above on the space station as the Control player or conquer your fears as you plunge headfirst towards planet Xanahspati as the Scout. Work in tandem to solve puzzles, uncover secrets, and ensure each other\u2019s survival as you traverse. But be careful, silence here\u2026 is quite deadly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477530/extras/8b2278e17ec87aa7efa5d7f3614c22ff.poster.webp?t=1750782473\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477530/extras/8b2278e17ec87aa7efa5d7f3614c22ff.webp?t=1750782473\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477530/extras/35a646bc71ae33dbc23d954835efa387.poster.webp?t=1750782473\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477530/extras/35a646bc71ae33dbc23d954835efa387.webp?t=1750782473\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the past, reveal the future,</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Towering ruins of intrigue await in this narrative driven world. Take in the melancholic sights and deduce the history of the unseen Padullurians as you navigate around monoliths of ancient, alien technology and the planet\u2019s harsh, bone-rending winds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477530/extras/8c6577cef5100d6a5f7842a61f4a9ae4.poster.webp?t=1750782473\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477530/extras/8c6577cef5100d6a5f7842a61f4a9ae4.webp?t=1750782473\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If at first you don\u2019t succeed\u2026,</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try and try again to hone your experience with each attempt. With every pass, you gain the most valuable of resources. The digital bodies may fade, but the ever-present minds remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477530/extras/b4f0975e7971aaa4ab2f34353fb4fcfd.poster.webp?t=1750782473\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477530/extras/b4f0975e7971aaa4ab2f34353fb4fcfd.webp?t=1750782473\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span> </p>",
    "short_description": "In this asymmetrical multiplayer co-op puzzle game, brave the treacherous unknown and endeavour on a deadly, desolate planet. Be the eyes from above or the scout on the ground and work together with a friend to uncover the mysteries and escape from the planet Xanahspati.",
